## 2. Legislative Mapping & Gap Assessment (HG 1627/2024)
Under the current legislative norms for the **2025–2029 Agricultural Register**, the following maps our codebase entities to the required chapters:

| Legal Chapter | Legislative Title & Scope | Codebase Entity | Gaps & Actions Needed |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Cap. I** | Composition of the Household | `PersoanaFizica` / `PersoanaJuridica` | Link relations relative to a **Head of Household**; track history of members entering/leaving the household. |
| **Cap. II.a** | Land Ownership | `Teren` / `CarteFunciara` | **Expose the existing `CarteFunciara` backend in the UI** (show CF Number, Topographic Number, and PDF export button). |
| **Cap. II.b** | Plot Identification | `Parcela` | **Expose new fields in UI forms:** Cadastral Number, Zone (Intravilan/Extravilan), and Use Right Holder (*Titular drept folosință*). |
| **Cap. III** | Agricultural Land Use Summary | Summary statistics | Automate calculations to group total land area by use category (arable, pasture, orchard) for tax/APIA reporting. |
| **Cap. IV** | Sown Arable Land | `CulturaParcela` | Map crop species to **standardized APIA/MADR crop codes** instead of free-text. |
| **Cap. V** | Fruit Trees & Pomiculture | *Missing* | Implement orchards and isolated fruit tree inventories. |
| **Cap. VI** | Irrigated Land | `SursaApa` | Implement annual logs of **actually irrigated surfaces** per parcel. |
| **Cap. VII** | Livestock Registry | `AnimalIndividual` / `EfectivGrup` | Standardize species lists (cattle, sheep, goats, pigs, bees, poultry). |
| **Cap. IX** | Machinery & Equipment | `Machinery` | Add ownership status (owned vs leased) and machinery power classes. |
| **Cap. XI** | Buildings & Outbuildings | `Cladire` | Add outer wall construction materials, roof materials (for tax brackets), and utility connections. |
| **Cap. XII** | Crop Production Volumes | `CulturaParcela` | Track crop production from greenhouses (*sere și solarii*) vs fields. |
| **Cap. XIII** | Succession Inquiries | *Missing* | Track notary notifications regarding deceased residents' estates. |
| **Cap. XIV** | Preemption Rights | *Missing* | Register public offers of land sales and preemptor status (Law 17/2014). |
| **Cap. XV** | Leases & Concessions | `ContractUtilizare` | Add overlap checking to prevent registering two active contracts on the same plot for the same date. |
| **Cap. XVI** | Special Mentions & Comodat | `ContractUtilizare` | Fully implemented (via Comodat/Închiriere types). |

