## 3. Advanced Interoperability (Legea 242/2022)
In accordance with **Legea nr. 242/2022** on interoperability and the **"once-only" principle** (the state cannot request documents it already holds), the application must evolve from manual input to automated registry synchronization:

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    App[Registru Agricol App]
    
    %% National Integrations
    App -- "REST/SOAP" --> PNI[Platforma Națională de Interoperabilitate]
    PNI -- "Identity Validation" --> DEPABD[DEPABD Registry]
    PNI -- "Company Status" --> ANAF[ANAF / ONRC Registry]
    
    %% Agricultural Registries
    App -- "Secure WSDL" --> RAN[RAN - Registrul Agricol Național]
    RAN --> ANCPI[ANCPI - Land Cadastre]
    
    %% Citizen Auth
    Citizen[Citizen User] -- "SSO" --> ROeID[ROeID Identity Portal] --> App
```

* **DEPABD Integration:** Query the national population database using the citizen's CNP to automatically populate full names, addresses, and check deceased status.
* **ANAF/ONRC Integration:** Query the company registry using the company's CUI to fetch fiscal addresses, company status, and legal representatives.
* **RAN / ANCPI Synchronization:** Synchronize local cadastral entries with the National Agricultural Registry (*Registrul Agricol Național*) via SOAP services with user-level digital signature certificates.

